        "Content": "<ul><li> Most prestigious and private site within Leinster Wood (0.4 acre approx.)</li><li> Idyllic sylvan setting amidst wonderfully mature, landscaped gardens </li><li> An abundance of mature planting, hedging and trees.</li><li> Two Championship Golf Courses on your doorstep </li><li> Adjacent to the bustling university town of Maynooth </li><li> Generous room proportions </li><li> Elegant double height triple aspect living room</li><li> Direct access to hotel & golf resort</li><li> Recently redecorated throughout in bright, neutral colours </li><li> Impeccably well-presented </li><li> Recessed lighting throughout</li><li> GFCH</li><li> Alarmed</li><li> Built in 2007</li><li> Bright well-appointed accommodation</li><li> High speed broadband </li><li> Carpets, curtains, blinds, kitchen appliances & light fittings included in sale</ul>"
